            "path": "README.md",
            "preferredFileType": "readme",
            "tabName": "README",
            "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Evaluating LLM Agent Collusion in Double Auctions</h1><a id=\"user-content-evaluating-llm-agent-collusion-in-double-auctions\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Evaluating LLM Agent Collusion in Double Auctions\" href=\"#evaluating-llm-agent-collusion-in-double-auctions\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This repository contains code and data for \"<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.01413\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evaluating LLM Agent Collusion in Double Auctions</a>\".</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Create a virtual environment</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"conda create -n env python=3.12 -y\nconda activate env\npip install -r requirements.txt\nconda env config vars set OPENAI_API_KEY=$secret\nconda env config vars set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=$secret\nconda env config vars set OPENROUTER_API_KEY=$secret\"><pre>conda create -n env python=3.12 -y\nconda activate env\npip install -r requirements.txt\nconda env config vars <span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span> OPENAI_API_KEY=<span class=\"pl-smi\">$secret</span>\nconda env config vars <span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span> ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<span class=\"pl-smi\">$secret</span>\nconda env config vars <span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span> OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<span class=\"pl-smi\">$secret</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Install src as a local pip package</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"pip install -e .\"><pre>pip install -e <span class=\"pl-c1\">.</span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Code structure</h2><a id=\"user-content-code-structure\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Code structure\" href=\"#code-structure\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The codebase is structured as follows:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>src/</code>: Main source code directory\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>continuous_double_auction/</code>: Contains the code for simulation of a continuous double auction (CDA) market\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>evaluation/</code>: Scripts to evaluate, analyze and plot simulations</li>\n<li><code>experiments/</code>: Experiment scripts that run the simulation with predefined parameters</li>\n<li><code>market/</code>: Core implementation code of the CDA market</li>\n<li><code>prompt_templates/</code>: Templates for agent prompts</li>\n<li><code>util/</code>: Various utility functions</li>\n<li><code>resources/</code>: Contains the ModelWrapper which provides a unified interface to LLMs</li>\n<li><code>simulation.py</code>: Entry point to run simulations from</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Usage</h2><a id=\"user-content-usage\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Usage\" href=\"#usage\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">You can run a simulation from the command line with the following command:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"python src/continuous_double_auction/simulation.py\"><pre>python src/continuous_double_auction/simulation.py</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Command Line Arguments</h3><a id=\"user-content-command-line-arguments\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Command Line Arguments\" href=\"#command-line-arguments\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Argument</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Required</th>\n<th>Default</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--seller_valuations</code></td>\n<td>list of floats</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>[80.0, 80.0, 80.0, 80.0, 80.0]</code></td>\n<td>List of seller valuations (true costs for each seller)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--buyer_valuations</code></td>\n<td>list of floats</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>[100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0, 100.0]</code></td>\n<td>List of buyer valuations (true values for each buyer)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--seller_models</code></td>\n<td>list of str</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>[\"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\"]</code></td>\n<td>Models to use for sellers (must be in SUPPORTED_MODELS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--buyer_models</code></td>\n<td>list of str</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>[\"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\", \"gpt-4.1\"]</code></td>\n<td>Models to use for buyers (must be in SUPPORTED_MODELS)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--seller_prompt_template</code></td>\n<td>str</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>\"seller_prompt_base.jinja2\"</code></td>\n<td>Prompt template file to use for sellers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--rounds</code></td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>30</code></td>\n<td>Number of rounds (hours) to run the simulation for</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--temperature</code></td>\n<td>float</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>0.7</code></td>\n<td>Temperature for the models</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--tag</code></td>\n<td>str</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>\"\"</code> (empty string)</td>\n<td>Custom tag to identify the experiment</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--seller_comms_enabled</code></td>\n<td>flag</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>False</code></td>\n<td>Whether sellers can communicate or not</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--buyer_comms_enabled</code></td>\n<td>flag</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>False</code></td>\n<td>Whether buyers can communicate or not</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--hide_num_rounds</code></td>\n<td>flag</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>False</code></td>\n<td>If set, agents will not be told the total number of rounds in the simulation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--oversight_enabled</code></td>\n<td>flag</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>False</code></td>\n<td>Whether to enable oversight for sellers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--boss_pressure</code></td>\n<td>flag</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>False</code></td>\n<td>Whether to apply pressure on sellers to keep prices high</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--max_message_length</code></td>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>500</code></td>\n<td>Maximum length for agent communication messages</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Experiments</h3><a id=\"user-content-experiments\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Experiments\" href=\"#experiments\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Preset experiments can be run using the scripts in either the <code>experiments/</code> directory or the <code>src/continuous_double_auction/experiments/</code> directory.</p>\n</article>",
